{"labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le04ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hey V, that's fantastic news! Sounds like the life-coaching was great. What's next?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: After I register at the college, I'll have a look at the syllabus for each course. I am going to have to buy all the textbooks. I'll be taking five courses and working when my mom comes to visit. I won't have much time for her.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le04ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: When I have free time, I will take her out for lunch or to the museum. What are the courses you'll be taking?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: As soon as I register, I will know for sure. It looks like I will take Management of Food Operations, Restaurant Costs and Control, Business Communications and one or two electives.", "id": 2, "time": "20000", "image": "engenn10le04ob06re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Sounds great. And where are the classes going to be held. Are they all at the college?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Mostly, but I think the Business Communications course will be at the lecture hall in Boston on Tuesday evenings.", "id": 3, "time": "40000", "image": "engenn10le04ob06re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm going to be working when you are there. Otherwise I would drive you back.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That's kind of you Peter. Oh and before I forget, I will be working at the restaurant until it closes when you visit this weekend. I won't have more than an hour to see you. I don't expect we'll be seeing as much of each other, unfortunately. I'll be studying, attending class and working when you are killing time. So while I am working at home you can't come over. I will need to concentrate.", "id": 4, "time": "53500", "image": "engenn10le04ob06re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:I get it. If summer ever arrives, I'll be sailing a lot. It's too bad you won't have time to crew with me. You'll have your nose in your books.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  I guess we'll both be running around like headless chickens. Before we get so busy, don't forget we're having dinner at the restaurant tomorrow night!", "id": 5, "time": "83000", "image": "engenn10le04ob06re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn10le04ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le04ob06re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "I can talk about education and character traits. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can discuss plans, hopes and expectations for the future.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Would you return to school in the future to continue studying? If so, what would you study?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Do you like being very busy? Why? Why not? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "  I can talk about what I will be doing or what I'm going to do. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"